    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193237_257087_23829" xmi:uuid="09831f9f-1fa5-4fd9-9860-0903beca443a" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1513612991314_46887_44247" xmi:uuid="3f482684-56c6-4366-b0de-4c62f536cda4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193237_257087_23829"/>
        <body>A RotationAboutAxes specifies an ordered sequence of the angles of rotation in a 3D cartesian coordinate space, consisting of a yaw, pitch and roll angle. The first value is the yaw angle that represents the angle by which the original frame (x0; y0; z0) is rotated first about the z-axis to yield an intermediate (x′, y′, z′) frame. The second value is the pitch angle that represents the angle by which the intermediate frame (x′, y′, z′) then is rotated about the y′-axis to yield another intermediate (x″, y″, z″) frame. The third value is the roll angle that represents the angle by which the (x″,y″, z″) frame is rotated about the x″-axis to yield the desired final (x, y, z) frame. </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>RotationAboutAxes</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194040_71831_28846" xmi:uuid="4de0b44e-5f7c-42a4-ae20-cbcf4876ef6b" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193247_360905_23846"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194040_130933_28847" xmi:uuid="bea17314-783f-432a-9619-92b135cd24ae" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <name>elements</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193306_729246_23951"/>
        <isOrdered>true</isOrdered>
        <isUnique>false</isUnique>
        <upperValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194781_875393_34813" xmi:uuid="10732ba7-fb2f-4ba1-95b3-af46fcbce7c1" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
          <value>3</value>
        </upperValue>
      </ownedAttribute>
    </packagedElement>
