    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193199_824691_23776" xmi:uuid="4e586dfb-c0ad-4813-9065-a67df390e3dc" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1513352159910_773577_86559" xmi:uuid="71bda26a-ac62-4105-8986-8d26eb5354e4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193199_824691_23776"/>
        <body>A ProductStructureLinkMotionAssociation is an association between a LinkMotionRelationship and an Occurrence within an AssemblyDefinition. </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>ProductStructureLinkMotionAssociation</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551459274142_604339_180340" xmi:uuid="49d1bd40-75fa-46c3-8319-46afffbda147" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551459573999_643368_180343" xmi:uuid="657a3d4a-fbb6-4bd6-8369-3b4a4e417026" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551459274142_604339_180340"/>
          <body>the attribute SubStructure that points to a SpecifiedOccurrence, shall belong with their attributes UpperUsage in a recursive way to an Occurrence that is called out by the &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_ProductDataManagement.htm#ViewOccurrenceRelationship.Related&lt;/path&gt; Related&lt;/a&gt; attribute belonging to the AssociatedTo.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1721730195349_395346_153291" xmi:uuid="a308c6c5-fa27-4c56-8ae4-a56911e33340" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1721730195349_495944_153292" xmi:uuid="9c8e30a6-8ba1-4b43-b7d0-9bcfe0468256" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//ProductStructureLinkMotionAssociation[@uid]"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="reference_uidRef" value="../Related/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="upper_usage" value="local-fn:MainUpperUsage(//DataContainer, Substructure/@uidRef)"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="$reference_uidRef = $upper_usage"&gt; The attribute SubStructure that points to a SpecifiedOccurrence, shall belong with their attributes UpperUsage in a recursive way to an Occurrence that is called out by the Related attribute belonging to the AssociatedTo. { -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; -rule_name:WR2 } &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR2</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193199_824691_23776"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551459274143_182583_180341" xmi:uuid="b7cc38df-c335-428e-8806-2cca9e387a4d" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.Substructure-&gt;closure(UpperUsage)-&gt;select(e | e.UpperUSage.oclIsUndefined()) = self.AssociatedTo.Related</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551459258095_137433_180336" xmi:uuid="97328ca8-f065-4cf9-8510-5c285f4a01ae" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1721730195340_604167_153289" xmi:uuid="b8f8006d-9191-4e02-9680-ac8de1ab6c62" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1721730195341_204677_153290" xmi:uuid="ca4fde7f-baae-47e1-8123-139f095a9d72" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//ProductStructureLinkMotionAssociation[@uid]"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="assembly_definition_by_associatedTo_relating_uid" value="../../@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="link_motion_relationship_uid" value="AssociatedMotion/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="link_motion_along_path_uid" value="//*/LinkMotionRelationship[@uid = $link_motion_relationship_uid]/../@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="motion_model_association_uid" value="//*/MotionModelAssociation/AssociatedModel[@uidRef = $link_motion_along_path_uid]/../@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="assembly_definition_by_associated_motion_uid" value="//*/MotionModelAssociation/AssociatedModel[@uidRef = $link_motion_along_path_uid]/../../@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="$assembly_definition_by_associatedTo_relating_uid = $assembly_definition_by_associated_motion_uid"&gt; The AssemblyDefinition called out by the AssociatedTo attribute of the MotionModelAssociation linked to the AssociatedMotion attribute of type LinkMotionAlongPath shall be the same as the one pointed by the Relating attribute of the AssociatedTo. { -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; -rule_name:WR1 -assembly_definition_by_associatedTo_relating_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$assembly_definition_by_associatedTo_relating_uid"/&gt; -link_motion_relationship_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$link_motion_relationship_uid"/&gt; -link_motion_along_path_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$link_motion_along_path_uid"/&gt; -motion_model_association_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$motion_model_association_uid"/&gt; -assembly_definition_by_associated_motion_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$assembly_definition_by_associated_motion_uid"/&gt; } &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551715798080_751855_185100" xmi:uuid="ce4bf8e7-4fc1-47a9-a8d1-e74e14e7d0be" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551459258095_137433_180336"/>
          <body>the AssemblyDefinition called out by the &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_Kinematics.htm#MotionModelAssociation.AssociatedTo&lt;/path&gt; AssociatedTo&lt;/a&gt; attribute of the MotionModelAssociation linked to the AssociatedMotion attribute of type LinkMotionAlongPath shall be the same as the one pointed by the &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_ProductDataManagement.htm#AssemblyOccurrenceRelationship.Relating&lt;/path&gt; Relating&lt;/a&gt; attribute of the AssociatedTo.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193199_824691_23776"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551459258104_268980_180337" xmi:uuid="fad35a29-b978-480b-9240-b047a81e0f6d" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.AssociatedTo.Relating = self.AssociatedMotion.Relating.motionModelAssociation.AssociatedTo</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
