          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193959_548409_28457"/>
          <body>identifies the LinkMotionRelationship that relates the ExternalOrComposedGeometricModel of an Occurrence to a LinkMotionAlongPath that is associated to the AssemblyDefinition via a MotionModelAssociation. </body>
