          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193959_977093_28458"/>
          <body>for the case of a nested assembly structure, identifies the SpecifiedOccurrence whose top UpperUsage is the Occurrence that is provided by AssociatedTo attribute. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
