        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193273_721908_23886"/>
        <body>A ToolCentrePointFrame is a type of AxisPlacement for the representation of a kinematic reference frame of a tool that may be attached to a KinematicLink of a Mechanism.</body>
