          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_19_0_4_2840147_1723210408763_795494_60665"/>
          <body>if Pairs[n] includes multiple DOFs like 'cylindrical_pair', one of 'rotation' or 'translation' has to be chosen for CouplingTypes[n].</body>
        </ownedComment>
