          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_19_0_4_2840147_1723210721814_379864_60692"/>
          <body>for 'gear_pair, if both Z axes of Pairs[1].Link2 and Pairs[2].Link2 have opposite directions, Radius[1] and Radius[2] shall not be specified and CouplingRatios[1] shall have a negative value.</body>
        </ownedComment>
