          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_19_0_4_2840147_1723210440509_19926_60668"/>
          <body>if Pairs[n] includes only one DOF like revolute_pair or prismatic_pair, CouplingTypes[n] has to be consistent with the DOF (here ‘rotation’ resp. ‘translation’).</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>IP6</name>
