          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_19_0_4_2840147_1723210821459_788601_60701"/>
          <body>for 'composed_homokinetic_pair', one Link1 of both coupled pairs may be the BaseLink of the Mechanism but both Link1 have to be different, while both Link2 have to be identical.</body>
        </ownedComment>
