          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_19_0_4_2840147_1722963404216_720824_60311"/>
          <body>the kind of coupling for couplers of Kind 'two_joint_coupler' or 'three_joint_coupler' that applies to each pair (either 'rotation' or 'translation').</body>
        </ownedComment>
