        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193134_775111_23625"/>
        <body>An InterpolatedConfigurationSegment is a specification of a single segment of an InterpolatedConfigurationSequence. An InterpolatedConfigurationSegment is defined by a MechanismState at a specific parameter value or time and the interpolation instruction to the next or first segment in the list.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>InterpolatedConfigurationSegment</name>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193782_790662_27546" xmi:uuid="4b82eec7-8a54-4e16-bb47-b7d48fd10b41" xmi:type="uml:Property">
