        <body>A TransitionCodeEnum is an enumeration that conveys the continuity properties of a motion along a PathSegment. The continuity referred to is geometric, not parametric continuity.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>TransitionCodeEnum</name>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1522143140858_69700_198518" xmi:uuid="e4a71bda-7aa0-4827-b3bd-ba99e6c84520" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <name>arm_mapping</name>
        <visibility>private</visibility>
        <type href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_SYSML_ARM-curve_transition_code"/>
        <isReadOnly>true</isReadOnly>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedLiteral xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194167_491365_29466" xmi:uuid="db898c3c-536e-4298-bd62-5c804302f645" xmi:type="uml:EnumerationLiteral">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1456299839955_279499_42915" xmi:uuid="9354ba6c-ed93-40c7-aada-779dd86e0d2a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194167_491365_29466"/>
          <body> the motion segments join, and their tangent vectors are parallel and have the same direction at the joint; equality of derivatives is not required.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>cont_same_gradient</name>
        <slot xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1522152548207_533363_200288" xmi:uuid="6e7f360c-784e-4c2d-a15b-d51d004cccbc" xmi:type="uml:Slot">
          <definingFeature xmi:idref="_18_4_1_271a0567_1522143140858_69700_198518"/>
          <value xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1522152548237_797595_200289" xmi:uuid="f67d8046-862c-4d48-96dc-25e40dc6e3bb" xmi:type="uml:InstanceValue">
            <instance href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_1_enumitem_SYSML_ARM-curve_transition_code-cont_same_gradient"/>
          </value>
        </slot>
      </ownedLiteral>
      <ownedLiteral xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194167_753503_29467" xmi:uuid="d6e2dfc4-acc0-4a6a-b307-340ca7d7805b" xmi:type="uml:EnumerationLiteral">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1456299851705_564020_42916" xmi:uuid="dc9ec65d-3dae-413a-867c-08cd574d2174" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194167_753503_29467"/>
          <body> the motion segments join, their tangent vectors are parallel and in the same direction, and their curvatures are equal at the joint; equality of derivatives is not required.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>cont_same_gradient_same_curvature</name>
        <slot xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1522152573043_584736_200292" xmi:uuid="38a5a790-d7b9-441c-9330-774f5e654b6f" xmi:type="uml:Slot">
          <definingFeature xmi:idref="_18_4_1_271a0567_1522143140858_69700_198518"/>
          <value xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1522152573056_378546_200293" xmi:uuid="dc74ecc8-ae10-4c93-bbab-0945aa297c7a" xmi:type="uml:InstanceValue">
            <instance href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_1_enumitem_SYSML_ARM-curve_transition_code-cont_same_gradient_same_curvature"/>
          </value>
        </slot>
      </ownedLiteral>
      <ownedLiteral xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194167_875118_29468" xmi:uuid="816df20e-66cc-4399-b044-8893cf3f7a2a" xmi:type="uml:EnumerationLiteral">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1456299861039_348071_42917" xmi:uuid="4223ec0e-fa1c-4428-ad97-1f1fc282ebc8" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194167_875118_29468"/>
          <body> the motion segments join, but no condition on their tangents is implied.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>continuous</name>
        <slot xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1522152586639_32194_200296" xmi:uuid="0b902605-f5c0-4228-8f9a-4806ef285103" xmi:type="uml:Slot">
