    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193139_222010_23640" xmi:uuid="ece591b4-e6da-47f3-b293-98e7e36a9a16" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455113407218_151891_42441" xmi:uuid="f92100aa-140a-4c95-8331-67b41ca80ad5" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193139_222010_23640"/>
        <body>A LinearPath is a type of PathSegment that describes a direction of travel along a straight line, starting from a previous position to a new end position. While doing so a link that is traversing along the path is continuously rotating from the start orientation to the end orientation. The path shall be traversed at linear speed, which is given by the previous time or parameter value and the new time or parameter value.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>LinearPath</name>
